                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b6ebc42-17c4-4e5a-bcd1-e165ea65d7f6",
                                "sense_id": "1e35e8da-bcb0-3a5f-948d-4f28d9a5d7a8",
                                "text": "He took the girls for a ride in his Lamborghini."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddb630d0-8251-4104-902a-76106154ecc4",
                                "sense_id": "1e35e8da-bcb0-3a5f-948d-4f28d9a5d7a8",
                                "text": "Lamborghini, meanwhile, had its most profitable year ever in 2020 and its second best sales year in the brand’s history. Only in 2019 were more Lamborghinis sold."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36bf2499-cdcd-4ac8-bd09-1099b6c0171c",
                                "sense_id": "1e35e8da-bcb0-3a5f-948d-4f28d9a5d7a8",
                                "text": "While there will be more V12 Lamborghini models in the future, they will be plug-in hybrids, the Italian supercar manufacturer said."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
